NOTICE ON PROVENANCE

This package is an independent implementation. No source code was taken
from any other repository. The public prior art that informed the METHOD is
credited in docs/PRIOR-ART.md and in the Provenance section of every
generated report, with each project's license named there.

In particular: the bootstrap-resampling approach and the risk-geometry
framing are credited to the prop-risk-geometry project
(https://github.com/dsilva42/prop-risk-geometry), which carries no license
file and is therefore all rights reserved. It is cited as the origin of the
idea, not copied. Every other project whose work is referenced -- LuxAlgo,
MaverickHQ, greybeard-code, jalv92, lhenriet-bit, Makeph and gabrielee5 --
is MIT licensed, and none of their code was copied either.

This is research tooling. It is not financial advice and it does not
predict the future. See the README for what the numbers mean.
